## getServerSideProps

Export `getServerSideProps` from a page file to render on every request. The
function receives the request context and returns either `props` or a redirect.
Use it only when the response depends on the caller: it opts the route out of
static generation (GSSP-MARK).

```tsx
// pages/dashboard.tsx
### not a heading: this line sits inside a fence
export async function getServerSideProps() {
  return { props: { now: Date.now() } }
}
```
